  "ai.blurb": "Paste the <em>clinical note</em> a doctor or nurse wrote, or <em>dictate it</em> — the AI drafts the diagnosis (KCD), Korean-medicine pattern U-code and procedure codes in one go. Each suggestion comes with <em>why this code</em> and <em>adjustment watch-outs</em> (diagnosis–treatment site match, Chuna frequency limit, 4-week certificate for minor injuries, herbal-decoction days, first/follow-up consultation fee), so the billing team only has to <em>confirm</em>. People decide; the AI searches.",
