  "users.sessionNote": "Within this window a reload or a reopened tab continues without the PIN (the idle lock still applies). The session key is stored only in this browser's IndexedDB as a non-exportable CryptoKey and is deleted on lock or expiry. Anyone at an unlocked browser can use the app within this window — use “Lock now” when you step away. Issuing a login or resetting a PIN asks for your PIN again. Director only.",
